# NestJS API Conventions

## Module Structure
```
apps/api/src/
  modules/
    auth/           # JWT login, refresh, RBAC guards
    pages/          # CRUD pages + sections, public by slug
    themes/         # CRUD themes, set active
    content/        # services, staff, gallery, blog
    media/          # upload, resize WebP/AVIF
    forms/          # booking + contact submit, notify
    settings/       # site-wide config
    seo/            # sitemap, robots.txt
  common/
    guards/         # JwtAuthGuard, RolesGuard
    decorators/     # @Public(), @Roles()
    interceptors/   # CacheInterceptor, LoggingInterceptor
    filters/        # GlobalExceptionFilter
```

## API Response Convention
```ts
// ✅ Luôn dùng class-validator DTO
export class CreateServiceDto {
  @IsString() @IsNotEmpty()
  category: string

  @IsNumber() @Min(0)
  price: number

  @IsObject()
  translations: Record<'vi' | 'en', { name: string; description?: string }>
}
```

## i18n — API trả về content theo locale
```ts
// Trong service method
getLocalizedContent(entity: any, lang: 'vi' | 'en') {
  const translations = entity.translations as Record<string, any>
  return translations[lang] ?? translations['vi'] // fallback về vi
}
```

## Redis Cache — bắt buộc cho public endpoints
```ts
@Controller('pages')
export class PagesController {
  // ✅ Cache public read 5 phút
  @Get(':slug')
  @UseInterceptors(CacheInterceptor)
  @CacheTTL(300)
  async getPage(@Param('slug') slug: string, @Query('lang') lang = 'vi') { ... }

  // Admin write → invalidate cache
  @Put(':id')
  @UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)
  async updatePage(@Param('id') id: string, ...) {
    await this.cacheManager.del(`page-${slug}`)
  }
}
```

## Rate Limiting — forms
```ts
// FormsController
@Post('booking')
@Throttle({ default: { limit: 5, ttl: 3600000 } }) // 5 req/IP/giờ
async submitBooking(@Body() dto: BookingFormDto) { ... }
```

## Error Handling
```ts
// ✅ Luôn throw HttpException có message rõ ràng
if (!page) throw new NotFoundException(`Page '${slug}' not found`)

// ✅ GlobalExceptionFilter log lỗi server-side
@Catch()
export class GlobalExceptionFilter implements ExceptionFilter { ... }
```

## Queue — Notification async
```ts
// ✅ ĐÚNG: không block request, dùng BullMQ
@InjectQueue('notifications') private notificationQueue: Queue

async submitBooking(dto: BookingFormDto) {
  await this.db.formSubmission.create({ data: dto })
  await this.notificationQueue.add('booking-email', dto)
  return { success: true }
}
```

## Auth — RBAC
```ts
// Public endpoint không cần auth
@Get() @Public()
async getPublicData() { ... }

// Admin endpoint
@Put() @UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard) @Roles('admin')
async updateContent() { ... }
```
